        <item>
            <title>0.2.4</title>
            <pubDate>Mon, 28 Sep 2026 05:14:30 +0800</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/cobaltdisco/torrid-releases</link>
            <sparkle:version>10</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.2.4</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2>New</h2>
<ul>
  <li>Use an HTTP or SOCKS5 proxy for downloads, torrents, video links and the built-in browser, set in Settings › Proxy.</li>
  <li>Let BitTorrent bypass the proxy with one switch.</li>
  <li>If the proxy can't be reached, Torrid tells you instead of quietly connecting directly.</li>
  <li>Proxy passwords are stored in your keychain.</li>
</ul>

<h2>Improved</h2>
<ul>
  <li>Downloads recover from stalled connections and responses that end early.</li>
  <li>Downloads work with more servers, including ones that limit requests or serve the same file from several mirrors.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
