        <item>
            <title>0.2.2</title>
            <pubDate>Tue, 22 Sep 2026 02:51:17 +0800</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/cobaltdisco/torrid-releases</link>
            <sparkle:version>8</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.2.2</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2>New</h2>
<ul>
  <li>Subscribe to RSS and Atom feeds to download new torrents automatically.</li>
  <li>Filter feed items with "Must contain" and "Must not contain" keywords, or with a regular expression.</li>
  <li>Feed addresses are stored in your keychain rather than in Torrid's database.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
